<rml><head><title>Playden — Welcome to Playden</title><link type="text/rcss" href="playden.rcss"/></head><body><div class="header"><span class="brand">playden</span><div class="rf-tabbar"><button id="home-tab">Home</button><button id="library-tab">Library</button><button id="settings-tab">Settings</button></div></div><div class="content"><div class="eyebrow">YOUR GAMES. YOUR SPACE.</div><h1 id="page-title">Welcome to Playden</h1><p id="page-intro">A new home for your PC library on PlayStation 5. Get comfortable, explore the shell, and make it yours.</p><div class="actions"><button id="open-library">Explore Library</button><button id="about">About this build</button></div></div><div id="diagnostic"></div><div class="hints">L1 / R1  Sections  ·  D-pad  Navigate  ·  Cross  Select  ·  Circle  Back</div><div class="version">FOUNDATION / 01</div></body></rml>